WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.740
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:49.790
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
arrived there from the human world</i>

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:56.590
<i>and met their dependable partner Digimon,
Agumon and friends.</i>

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:03.600
<i>They are currently on a journey
to save the world together.</i>

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:11.110
<i>Long ago, a war broke out between light
and darkness in the Digital World.</i>

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:16.420
<i>The bringer of destruction and darkness
born from that war,</i>

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:20.780
<i>Millenniumon,
is about to return to the world again.</i>

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:28.390
<i>To prevent this, the Chosen Ones must find
the Digimon who are reviving Millenniumon</i>

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.540
<i>at the Sealed Grounds, FAGA.</i>

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:36.420
<i>The children were attacked
by an eerie sphere, Sephirothmon.</i>

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.720
<i>The Chosen Ones who got trapped inside</i>

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:44.760
<i>were overwhelmed by attacks
from various Digimon data.</i>

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:52.100
<i>However, Angemon super evolved
into Holyangemon.</i>

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:59.400
<i>The beaming, glowing sword opened a path
that allowed them to escape danger.</i>

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.660
<i>One night, during their journey...</i>

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.920
Taichi?

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.840
Where did they go so late at night?

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.560
This way!

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:27.260
I smell Joe and Gomamon over this way!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.280
What's all this?

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.290
Hm?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:50.370
A faucet?

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:54.790
THE VILLAINS OF THE WASTELANDS

00:03:55.290 --> 00:04:00.050
I wonder if this is recreated
from our world's data too.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:05.340
So, where's Joe Senpai?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.810
He got taken away.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.150
Another Digimon and a human, eh?

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:24.590
Are you guys friends of that wimpy human
and that small white one?

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.050
Y-Yeah.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:28.500
You saw Joe Senpai and Gomamon?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.830
Which way did they get taken away?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.660
Both ways.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.940
Oops.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:40.730
Oh, don't worry about me.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.360
The wimp, that way.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.940
The white one, that way.

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.240
They were taken away separately.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.520
I see, thanks!

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:53.650
I'll get Joe Senpai. You get Gomamon.
Let's meet here once we save them.

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:54.600
Okay!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.860
Wait.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.380
You know how to track him down
with your nose like your partner?

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.650
No.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.490
But I just have to go this way, right?

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.350
You can't breathe fire
and you don't got a tail.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:16.000
What do you intend do, human?

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:18.880
I'll think of something.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.380
I can guide you there at least.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.260
Come along, kid.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.110
That'd help a lot!

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:30.220
But please don't call me a kid.
I'm Taichi Yagami!

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:36.540
I'm Nohemon, the guardian of water.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.520
Water... you mean
that faucet back there?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.520
NOHEMON

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:44.030
<i>That's the only water source around here.</i>

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:49.530
And the villains trying to take over
that source are relentless.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:56.310
<i>Your foolish friends came near that water
without knowing the situation,</i>

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:01.040
<i>and were unfortunately spotted
by the two groups of villains.</i>

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:09.340
<i>Those two have been fighting
to control the water for a long time.</i>

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:25.500
And again, they argued who would punish
the outsider that touched the water,

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:29.860
so they decided to
take them back separately to settle it.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:39.600
"So you were just watching?
What happened to your guardian duties?"

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.080
says your face.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.740
C'mon, let's go.

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:00.230
Y-Yeah.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:06.330
So that's one of the villain's hideout.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.230
Yeah.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.530
Joe Senpai's down there.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.740
<i>Taichi, I made it.</i>

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.810
I can smell Gomamon from inside.

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:22.770
I'm going in!

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.900
Okay, be careful.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:25.920
<i>Okay!</i>

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:27.800
Nohemon.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.100
Thanks for guiding me.
I'll be fine from here.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.260
Leave the rest to us!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.640
We can't just save two and leave the rest.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.270
We'll do something about them too.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:43.650
Hey!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:47.460
That way, the water
will belong to everyone again.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.900
See ya then!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.410
How did it come to this?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.710
This way! I smell water from this way!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.300
There's really water! This is amazing!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:20.080
See? I told you that I smelled water!

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.580
This feels good... Wait.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:23.690
Huh?

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:37.290
All of you!
I won't give into such wrongful arrest!

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:39.580
My lawyer! Call my lawy--

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:43.830
I'm sorry!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.330
Do it.

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.140
Huh?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.870
Hey, kid, that's a problem.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.140
You see, that water's ours.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.750
Hmm...

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:11.400
If you claim something is yours,
make sure to put your name on it!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:12.790
Huh?

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:18.010
Besides, your claim that it's yours
is questionable to start with.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:21.720
Isn't that an unlawful monopoly
of public property?!

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:25.040
Oh, I'm copying Joe. Do I sound like him?

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.540
Who cares?!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.800
Going in, going in!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.800
Hi, I'm going in!

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.120
You let your guard down.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.000
Nohemon?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:14.810
You saved me... but why?

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:21.300
Originally, that used to be
a peaceful place with an ordinary well.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:27.770
<i>Everybody gathered there
and was allowed to drink the water.</i>

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.310
<i>However...</i>

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.590
<i>The villains who became curious
about the rumors</i>

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:43.830
<i>began to gather,
trying to make the water theirs.</i>

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.830
<i>I stood up to them and...</i>

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:02.530
The Digimon who lived around here
have all ran off.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:06.240
Even the guardian of water
who've managed with just this bow

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:08.140
is now in this shape.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.610
However,

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:17.090
I haven't fallen so low as to let some
human kid do something reckless.

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:18.650
I'll tag along.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.740
Thank you!

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:26.240
What's up with this guy?
He's beating himself up on his own.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.520
But it isn't enough.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:35.510
You touched our water
and even wrecked our hideout.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:38.770
How are you gonna pay for that, huh?!

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:40.280
<i>Stop!</i>

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.260
Huh?

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.010
Joe Senpai!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.140
<i>I came to save you!</i>

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.970
Who's there?!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.040
Where are you?!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.480
Above you!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.790
P-Put out the fire!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.040
What are you doing?!
Put it out! Put out the fire!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.040
GAOSSMON

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.170
That's... the boss?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:24.110
That's the boss of this place, Gaossmon.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.680
Well, now's our chance!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:26.760
Wait!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.580
TYRANOMON

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:53.370
That one, Tyranomon,
is Gaossmon's sworn brother.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.750
Tyranomon surpassed the boss in evolution,

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:01.050
but still listens to Gaossmon obediently.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.520
Ugh, stop! Don't move around on your own!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.550
I'll do it. Teach me how to shoot.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:30.780
What?!

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.250
Calm down, brother!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.270
Nohemon! So you're behind this!

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.920
C'mon, that way!

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:54.060
No, aim for the water jug.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.460
Aim well... Don't hold your breath!

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:04.070
Take long, deep breaths.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:14.870
Listen, shoot the moment you exhale!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.880
W-What?!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.850
-Alright!
-Good job!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.640
Senpai!

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.150
Th-Thank you!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.660
How dare they!
Don't let them escape! Get 'em!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.080
Gomamon!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.060
Agumon!

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.170
Where do they keep coming from?!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.060
Baby Flame!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.480
Gomamon, where are you?!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.920
I'm here!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:27.980
Huh?

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:32.840
Oh, okay. I don't know what's going on,
but let's escape!

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.430
I don't know what's going on either.

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:37.830
Marching Fishes!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:46.090
Go, go!
We're not letting you escape!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.090
MINIDEKACHIMON

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:57.100
Stop! Stop right there!

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.910
Hey, kid, this doesn't look good!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:02.200
What?

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:04.100
Agumon, how's your side?!

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.790
I'm with Gomamon!

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.610
But we're being chased!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.380
That's fine!
Lead them to the faucet like that!

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.030
Got it!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.140
There they are!

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:19.640
Taichi!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.870
Joe!

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.180
We'll be sandwiched!

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.630
Every crisis is an opportunity!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.300
Those guys!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.400
Don't tell me they came to ambush us?!

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.890
That Gaossmon! What a petty plan!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:44.890
Oh, we'll settle this today
once and for all! We'll crush you!

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:47.480
You're the one who's gonna be crushed!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.650
What's this?!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:54.780
Can they tell apart who's on whose side?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.220
Who knows?

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.300
They're both gonna get crushed.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.240
Senpai!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.410
Oh, y-yeah!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.180
Agumon Evolution!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.240
Greymon!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.870
Gomamon Evolution!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.720
Ikkakumon!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.850
Wha...

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.350
Say what?!

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:47.580
Wha...

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.380
Go, go! Get 'em!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.090
Hup!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.770
Now, come!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.060
ATAMADEKACHIMON

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.240
Here we go!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.340
Taichi!

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:21.620
Do it!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.500
Shoot!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.400
Nice work!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:39.880
Nohemon!

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.510
Turn every crisis into an opportunity, eh?

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.440
Leave that one to me.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.280
Nohemon?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.660
Please... let me do it.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.790
Greymon.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.290
Got it.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.080
Shoot!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.440
We did it!

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:02.550
Wha...

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.430
Why you little!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.680
We won't fall for that again!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.950
We did it, Nohemon!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:28.530
I guess I helped out a little.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.690
I paid back what I owed.

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:41.690
If you quit being
your sleazy brother's puppet

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:44.610
and promise to stop troubling others,

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.360
I'll show you mercy and let you live.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:49.100
Go and get outta here.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:52.640
Umm... hup!

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.190
H-Hey!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:07.620
Looks like Tyranomon likes you.
Good work, Nohemon!

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.080
Hmph.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.370
Oh, they're back!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:21.500
Taichi!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.280
Where did you guys go?

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.680
Just for a morning walk.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.180
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.180
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:33.080
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:35.330
<i>Gerbemon.</i>

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:38.020
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:38.710
<i>This Digimon mutated
from a trash can that empties data.</i>

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:40.680
TYPE: MUTANT

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:43.290
<i>"Unchi Bazooka" is Gerbemon's specialty!
"Poop Bazooka"...? Huh?</i>

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: UNCHI BAZOOKA

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:45.090
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:49.550
<i>A trash can said to suck in anything
like a black hole! How interesting!</i>

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:52.760
<i>When I asked Gerbemon
if I could go inside,</i>

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Tentomon stopped me immediately.</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:00.020
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:05.780
<i>Taichi and Wargreymon fearlessly
rise against Mugendramon.</i>

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:07.860
<i>A shocking turn of events ensue!</i>

00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:11.910
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Attack of Mugendramon"</i>

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:14.740
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
